- Unit: `test_dockerfile_python_deps_cache.py`, `test_dockerfile_mkl_source_stack.py`, `test_dockerfile_jemalloc_cpython.py`, `test_pyproject_image_build_extra.py`, `test_supervisord_pipeline_python.py`, `test_hpcperfstats_ini_example.py` (no interpreter keys), `test_python_abi_startup_log.py`
- Compose smoke: web `python3` is 3.14.7 GIL; live pipeline argv is `/opt/python3.14t/...` and logs `python_abi … Py_GIL_DISABLED=1`; `/proc/self/maps` and `LD_PRELOAD`/`ld.so.preload` show jemalloc on both ABIs; after image rebuild, GIL and 3.14t `numpy.show_config(mode="dicts")` mention MKL and `numexpr.use_vml` is true

